# Never bake these into the image.
# Copyrighted / private / user data (mounted read-only at runtime instead):
roms/
scenarios/states/
*.state
# Run artifacts + local caches:
runs/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Repo plumbing not needed to run the harness:
.git/
.github/
.pre-commit-config.yaml
tests/
blog/
web/
# Docs (keep README.md — pyproject references it for the build). `*.md` is
# root-only in Docker, so the packaged prompt below is safe — the negation
# makes it explicit.
*.md
!README.md
!src/pokebench/harness/prompts/system.md
